diff --git a/docs/en/CHANGELOG.md b/docs/en/CHANGELOG.md
index 7aae62a..d6761ef 100644
--- a/docs/en/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/en/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -75,6 +75,8 @@
 
 - **Fix: a native `<select>` popup was unreadable for its whole column ([#164](https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/issues/164))**. In the host's **native** selects (e.g. Settings → Model → Provider) the popup came up white-on-white in dark mode, and pale-on-pale once "Custom settings" set the *primary* ink to a light colour (our own drawn dropdowns were unaffected). Root cause: Chromium's native popup is a **separate document** — its canvas only picks up the select's own background when that background is **opaque**, and this plugin turns the host's background tokens into glass ⇒ the popup falls back to the default **light** canvas, while the option text **inherits** the select's ink (light in dark mode, and arbitrarily light when the user customises it). Two triggers, one mechanism. The fix gives every option row its own pair — an opaque row background plus an ink guaranteed to contrast with it (`--we-popup-row-bg` / `--we-popup-row-ink`) — and derives that pair **from the effective ink**: the new pure function `wePopupRowPair(inkHex)` binary-searches the row background toward black/white until it reaches ≥4.6:1 against the ink by WCAG relative luminance (same family as the tint clamp, same 0.1 rounding headroom). With no custom ink it reproduces today's pairing **bit for bit** (light `#ffffff` + the host's dark ink, dark `#1e1f26` + the host's light ink) — a theme flip alone cannot save the custom-ink case, because the light theme's default light row *is* the white-on-white one. The selected row is pinned separately to an accent fill + accent ink (the UA's Highlight blue ignores the row pair, and a blue row with a user-chosen ink is uncontrolled). The rule uses the element selector `select option` and hangs on no host CSS-module hash ⇒ it keeps working across host upgrades, and it covers our own picker too (whose higher-specificity rule is kept). `verify-readability` gains F8 (global / selected / our-picker rules + 4 negative controls) and F9 (extracts `wePopupRowPair` from the artifact and recomputes a seven-ink contrast grid — worst case mid-grey `#7f7f7f` = 4.60:1 — plus 1 negative control). **Follow-up patch inside the same PR (four items)**: (1) the selected row's **fill** now reads `--we-accent-src` instead of `--we-accent` — the settings-window scope block ends by pinning `--we-accent` to `initial` and every existing consumer inside it reads `-src`, while the #164 reproduction path sits *inside* that window, so the original spelling fell through to the fallback colour there and stopped tracking the user's accent (the gap found in review); (2) the selected row's **ink** is now emitted by the new pure function `weCheckedRowInk(accentHex)`, which picks whichever of black/white contrasts **more** instead of reusing the host buttons' 0.45 threshold — that threshold picks white on mid-luminance accents (only 3.22:1 on the default blue `#4f8cff`), whereas taking the better arm yields a worst case of **4.72:1** across nine accents; (3) added `select optgroup` (group labels go through the same mechanism, so pinning `option` alone left them in the same hole); (4) `verify-readability` gains two more negative controls (F8-5 / F8-6) and F10 (a nine-accent grid plus 1 negative control that re-creates the 0.45 threshold and must fail). **Client-side only ⇒ refresh the page to apply.**
 
+- **Fix: during an upgrade window the "author's own" dialog could not succeed, and its failure handed users the raw English** ([#188](https://github.com/elysia395/dsh-wallpaper-engine/issues/188)). 1.3.2 moved the preset schema tag from `dsh-we/glass-preset@1` to `dsh-we/profile-preset@1`, and an upgrade is **the market replacing files on disk while the running host process still executes the old route code**: the client bundle rev derives from `lib/client.js`'s mtime / size ⇒ one page refresh hands the user the new client, the notice re-shows, the dialog's gate passes — while the backend is still old, and an old backend reading new-tag files must come back `version-obsolete`. **Four things stack into that guaranteed failure**: ① the dialog never asks whether this host route currently works; ② `resolvePreset()` collapsed **every** bundled-layer read failure into `missing` ⇒ the same file that deserved a 422 (whose copy was already localized: "this preset's version is obsolete") came back as 404 `unknown preset`, so that 422 branch was **dead code** for the bundled layer; ③ the client only recognized a *bare* 404/405 as "the host has no such route" and **not** a 404 with a JSON body ⇒ the host's own words, `unknown preset`, went straight to the screen; ④ the failure path never wrote the seen sentinel ⇒ every refresh popped the dialog again. **The fix**: ① probe `GET /glass-presets/factory-author` before opening and pop only on 200 (during the window it neither pops nor writes the sentinel ⇒ after a restart it pops once as usual; the verdict is cached at module level, a page-level fact, so multiple panels probe once — the same shape as the notice's art gate); ② the bundled layer **keeps its read-failure reason** (a real absence is still 404, semantics unchanged; only "file present but unreadable" reaches 422); ③ the three 404s now carry `reason` (`missing` / `tombstone`) and `id`, and the client uses `reason` to tell three different ways out — really absent / deleted before / an old host — instead of dropping the host's English on the screen; ④ a failure no longer re-pops. **Criteria** (`test/verify-presets.mjs`): section ③e wires its own harness per the family's ctx contract (an old-tag file cannot be dropped into the in-repo bundled dir), points the bundled layer at an isolated old-tag file, and asserts 422 + `reason=version-obsolete` + `origin=builtin` with the localized copy, that a real absence is still 404 `missing`, and that a repeated DELETE is 404 `tombstone`; section ④c brace-matches `glassPresetFailureReason()` out of the source text and **run it with stubs** (grepping three reasons is not evidence), asserting an old host (no `reason`) lands on "restart DSH" while really-absent and deleted each get their own copy, and that all three carry non-empty English in `src/i18n-copy*`. Mutation check: restore the collapse to `missing`, drop the body-bearing 404, or merge the three copies back into one ⇒ each turns red. **Both host and client halves changed ⇒ restart `dsh web` to apply** (a page refresh is not enough — which is exactly what this fix is about).
+
 ### v1.3.1 (2026-10-12 · published on npm)
 
 > Increments after v1.3.0-r2; the `NOTICE_VERSION` sentinel went `1.3.1` → `1.3.2` (the notice body switched to the v1.3.2 copy ⇒ users who saw the r2 notice will see it once more), while `package.json`'s `version` is `1.3.1` (the sentinel and this section's version number move on their own schedules here — the notice jump is `111816a`).
diff --git a/test/verify-presets.mjs b/test/verify-presets.mjs
index dc7c7b6..278c0b7 100644
--- a/test/verify-presets.mjs
+++ b/test/verify-presets.mjs
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ import { dirname, join, resolve } from 'node:path';
 import { fileURLToPath, pathToFileURL } from 'node:url';
 import { Readable, Writable } from 'node:stream';
 import { stripComments } from './tools/js-text.mjs';
+import { scopeText } from './tools/src-scope.mjs';
 import { installWeTShim } from './tools/weT-shim.mjs';
 installWeTShim();
 
@@ -1280,6 +1281,77 @@ section('③d 资产段：install-assets 落盘与 applied 语义、export→imp
   }
 }
 
+// ── ③e #199：随包层读失败原因**不塌缩** + 404 带上下文 ═════════════════════════
+section('③e #199：随包层旧 tag ⇒ 422「版本已作废」（不是 404）、404 带 reason=missing/tombstone');
+{
+  // 为什么另起一个台架：`lib/index.js` 把随包层钉死成**仓内** `lib/glass-presets`
+  // （GLASS_PRESET_BUILTIN_DIR），守卫不能往仓内随包目录塞一份旧 tag 文件（那是改工作树）。
+  // 这里按族文件头的 ctx 契约自己接线，随包层指向隔离区里的一份**旧 tag** 文件 ——
+  // 复刻真实形态：升级窗口期磁盘上的随包文件已是另一版 tag，而宿主内存里是这份路由代码。
+  const probeMod = await import(pathToFileURL(join(root, 'lib', 'routes', 'presets.js')).href);
+  const probeBuiltin = join(ISO, 'probe-builtin');
+  const probeUser = join(ISO, 'probe-user');
+  rmSync(probeBuiltin, { recursive: true, force: true });
+  rmSync(probeUser, { recursive: true, force: true });
+  mkdirSync(probeBuiltin, { recursive: true });
+  mkdirSync(probeUser, { recursive: true });
+  writeFileSync(join(probeBuiltin, 'factory-legacy.json'),
+    JSON.stringify({ $schema: OLD_TAG, id: 'factory-legacy', name: '旧版出厂预设', values: {} }) + '\n');
+  writeFileSync(join(probeBuiltin, 'factory-live.json'),
+    JSON.stringify({ $schema: 'dsh-we/profile-preset@1', id: 'factory-live', name: '现役出厂预设', values: {} }) + '\n');
+  const probeRoutes = [];
+  probeMod.registerGlassPresetsRoutes({
+    register(r) { probeRoutes.push(r); return () => {}; },
+  }, {
+    disposers: [],
+    base: '/wallpaper-engine',
+    glassPresetsDir: () => probeUser,
+    glassPresetsBuiltinDir: probeBuiltin,
+    log: { warn: () => {} },
+    ensureDirOnce: (d) => mkdirSync(d, { recursive: true }),
+    atomicWriteFileP: async (p, buf) => { mkdirSync(dirname(p), { recursive: true }); writeFileSync(p, buf); },
+  });
+  const probe = probeRoutes.find((r) => r.path && r.path.endsWith('/glass-presets'));
+  check('台架自检：探针路由已注册（随包/用户层独立接线）', Boolean(probe), probe && probe.path);
+
+  if (probe) {
+    // ★ 主判据（#199 的核心）：随包层"**文件在**、tag 作废" ⇒ 422 + reason=version-obsolete。
+    //   #199 之前 `resolvePreset()` 把随包层的**一切**读失败塌缩成 `missing` ⇒ 这里回 404
+    //   `unknown preset`，同一条 GET 上**已经本地化**的 422「版本已作废」成了死代码（#188）。
+    const legacy = await callRoute(probe, fakeReq(P('factory-legacy'), 'GET'));
+    const legacyBody = bodyJson(legacy) || {};
+    check('★ #199：随包层旧 tag ⇒ 422 version-obsolete（塌缩回 missing 即红）',
+      legacy.__state.status === 422 && legacyBody.reason === 'version-obsolete'
+      && legacyBody.origin === 'builtin' && legacyBody.shadowsBuiltin === false,
+      'status=' + legacy.__state.status + ' reason=' + legacyBody.reason + ' origin=' + legacyBody.origin);
+    check('★ #199：该 422 上屏的是**已本地化**的「版本已作废」那条，不是英文 unreadable',
+      typeof legacyBody.error === 'string' && legacyBody.error.includes('版本已作废')
+      && !/unreadable/.test(legacyBody.error),
+      String(legacyBody.error));
+
+    const absent = await callRoute(probe, fakeReq(P('factory-absent'), 'GET'));
+    const absentBody = bodyJson(absent) || {};
+    check('随包层真不存在 ⇒ 仍是 404 missing（origin 语义不回退）',
+      absent.__state.status === 404 && absentBody.error === 'unknown preset'
+      && absentBody.reason === 'missing' && absentBody.id === 'factory-absent' && !absentBody.origin,
+      'status=' + absent.__state.status + ' reason=' + absentBody.reason + ' origin=' + absentBody.origin);
+
+    const delOk = await callRoute(probe, fakeReq(P('factory-live'), 'DELETE'));
